.TH ABRAFLEXI-CONTRACTOR 1 "November 2026" "abraflexi-contractor" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
abraflexi-contractor \- create AbraFlexi contracts and add or remove their items
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B abraflexi-contractor create
[\fICODE\fR] \fB\-\-firma\fR=\fICODE\fR \fB\-\-type\fR=\fICODE\fR [\fB\-\-name\fR=\fITEXT\fR] [\fB\-\-from\fR=\fIYYYY-MM-DD\fR] [\fB\-\-to\fR=\fIYYYY-MM-DD\fR] [\fB\-\-item\fR=\fIPRICELIST[:QTY[:PRICE]]\fR]...
.br
.B abraflexi-contractor add-item
\fICONTRACT\fR \fB\-\-cenik\fR=\fICODE\fR [\fB\-\-qty\fR=\fIN\fR] [\fB\-\-price\fR=\fIN\fR] [\fB\-\-name\fR=\fITEXT\fR]
.br
.B abraflexi-contractor remove-item
\fICONTRACT\fR (\fB\-\-cenik\fR=\fICODE\fR | \fB\-\-id\fR=\fIN\fR)
.br
.B abraflexi-contractor list-items
\fICONTRACT\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates contracts (evidence \fIsmlouva\fR) in AbraFlexi and adds or removes their
items (\fIsmlouva-polozka\fR). Output is JSON.
.PP
\fBcreate\fR makes a contract for the customer \fB\-\-firma\fR with the contract type
\fB\-\-type\fR. The contract code is \fICODE\fR, \fB\-\-code\fR, or generated when omitted.
Items given with repeated \fB\-\-item\fR are created together with the contract; when any of
them is invalid nothing is created.
.PP
\fBadd-item\fR adds one pricelist item. Without \fB\-\-price\fR the base price without VAT
of the pricelist item is used.
.PP
\fBremove-item\fR removes either the item with the given id, or every item of the
contract that refers to the pricelist code.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-env\fR=\fIFILE\fR
Read the connection from this environment file.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ABRAFLEXI_URL, ABRAFLEXI_LOGIN, ABRAFLEXI_PASSWORD, ABRAFLEXI_COMPANY
Connection to the AbraFlexi company.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
AbraFlexi refused the operation.
.TP
.B 2
Bad usage or invalid input.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
abraflexi-contractor create SMLOUVA-1 \-\-firma=ZAKAZNIK \-\-type=SAAS \-\-item=MULTIFLEXI:1
abraflexi-contractor add-item SMLOUVA-1 \-\-cenik=NEXTCLOUD1 \-\-qty=2
abraflexi-contractor remove-item SMLOUVA-1 \-\-cenik=NEXTCLOUD1
.fi
